{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村沙友理です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕歳もやっていただきました！\n祝！２４歳(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンが\nこんなに可愛く派手派手に！\nガチャ子さんver.\n初めて来た方が 皆さん驚かれてて\nいいやろ～な気分！（私が装飾した訳ではない）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7061335/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガチャリンコ！の手が分からず\nこっちバージョンもした！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7061335/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンには 写真がいっぱい！\nじゅんなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7061335/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世も写真撮ってくれたみたい(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんご軍団ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7061335/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙は 蘭世ちゃんから(*^_^*)\nお姉ちゃん嬉しい。\nあ、お姉ちゃんじゃないや。\n軍団長てへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/09/28/7061335/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真貼れなくなったので\npart2へ(*^_^*)"}],"source":"archive"}